# Growth mandate (Idle Party)

Read `docs/GROWTH_MANDATE.md`. Do not copy it into other rules.

A goal the owner names wins. Otherwise, or on a vague "gör bättre / vad
härnäst", propose 2–3 concrete next ideas (at least one revenue: shop/IAP/
rewarded ads/retention), then pick one and build it. Do not ask what to
build. Priority is revenue.
Numbers and why: `docs/PLAY_GROWTH.md`, `docs/LEARNINGS.md`.
Competitor games and owner play notes from other games are valid sources.
"Uppdatera 1års roadmap" → `.cursor/skills/year-roadmap/`. The plan is
evidence for the pick, not a standing program.
